PROGRAM quoted unit price

REQUEST quote unit price
  GIVEN total is decimal
  AND units is integer
  GIVEN price is 0.0
  WHEN quote total across units into price
  OUTPUT price is decimal

WHEN quote <total> across <units> into <price>
  GIVEN total is decimal
  AND units is integer
  AND price is decimal
  REQUIRE units > 0
  divide total by units rounded to 2 places using half_even into price

SCENARIO recurring quotient rounds down
GIVEN total is 1.0
AND units is 3
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == 0.33

SCENARIO recurring quotient rounds up
GIVEN total is 2.0
AND units is 3
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == 0.67

SCENARIO midpoint retains even cent
GIVEN total is 10.05
AND units is 2
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == 5.02

SCENARIO midpoint advances odd cent
GIVEN total is 10.15
AND units is 2
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == 5.08

SCENARIO negative midpoint retains even cent
GIVEN total is -10.05
AND units is 2
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == -5.02

SCENARIO exact quotient is unchanged
GIVEN total is 1.0
AND units is 4
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == 0.25

SCENARIO zero total
GIVEN total is 0.0
AND units is 3
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN price == 0

SCENARIO unit count must be positive
GIVEN total is 1.0
AND units is 0
REQUEST quote unit price
THEN fails with "assertion_failed"
